    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363570/extras/9eacb1f62a08736c256f23810c45d546.webp?t=1751376694\" width=600 height=40 /></span><i><strong>Symphorix</strong></i> redefines the Roguelite Survivor experience by blending soothing, ambient aesthetics with deep, strategic roguelite mechanics. In this universe, it's not about frantic reactions or memorizing every beat \u2013 the music unfolds naturally, guiding you through an immersive soundscape filled with mesmerizing tracks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363570/extras/914851d48dae133f599281965473f795.webp?t=1751376694\" width=600 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Ambient, Music-Infused Strategy:</strong></i> In Symphorix, the song plays out as it will. Instead of racing against time, your focus is on pre-planning the perfect build. Imagine knowing that the c# notes dominate your track \u2013 your task is to configure your Core to unleash a barrage of missiles at those moments, without having to chase every beat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Relaxed Intensity &amp; Deep Customization:</strong></i> Enjoy a gameplay experience that marries the serenity of ambient music with the depth of a survivorlike roguelite. Customize your Core\u2019s nodes and assign distinct attack types to specific musical notes, letting you shape the battlefield before the chaos even begins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Procedurally Generated, Yet Predictable by Design:</i></strong> While the enemies and bosses emerge from the music\u2019s natural rhythm, their patterns are set by the song\u2019s structure. This means you can study the frequency of key notes \u2013 like the recurring c# \u2013 and tailor your strategy accordingly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Evolving Tactics &amp; Synergies:</strong></i> Discover powerful combinations and synergies as your Core\u2019s abilities interact with the musical landscape. With each track, the game invites you to premeditate your moves, turning the experience into a thoughtful, methodical dance of strategy and anticipation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Custom Tracks &amp; Live Mode:</strong></i> With over 150 original tracks or the option to import your own MP3s, every run offers a unique ambient journey. The game transforms your chosen music into a dynamic, interactive canvas where planning and creativity pave the way to survival.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363570/extras/25da1d67fa7fa2fd3a5e472632bbb151.poster.avif?t=1751376694\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363570/extras/25da1d67fa7fa2fd3a5e472632bbb151.webm?t=1751376694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363570/extras/25da1d67fa7fa2fd3a5e472632bbb151.mp4?t=1751376694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363570/extras/a3823492dc19b360f34b1aad42cdc732.webp?t=1751376694\" width=600 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Core Configuration &amp; Pre-Planning:</strong></i> Before the battle begins, design your Core by assigning notes to its nodes. Whether you choose explosive projectiles or focused beams, the decision is yours \u2013 and it\u2019s based on understanding your song's structure, not reacting to each beat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Serene Yet Challenging Encounters:</strong></i> Face off against procedurally generated enemies and uniquely crafted bosses whose behaviors mirror the flow of the music. Every encounter is a testament to your strategic foresight rather than reflex-driven chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Progressive, Rewarding Gameplay:</strong></i> Earn upgrades and unlock new abilities as you progress, further refining your build for each song. The challenge is to anticipate, adapt, and create a Core that perfectly aligns with the musical journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363570/extras/572ced6b26278dff30af83308ab19882.poster.avif?t=1751376694\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363570/extras/572ced6b26278dff30af83308ab19882.webm?t=1751376694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363570/extras/572ced6b26278dff30af83308ab19882.mp4?t=1751376694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363570/extras/99d55e6ec2240d090d9066da96715f08.webp?t=1751376694\" width=600 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world where the music is both a backdrop and a blueprint. In Symphorix, every track is a canvas for your strategic genius \u2013 a place where you craft your destiny through thoughtful preparation and tactical precision. Embrace the ambient beauty, plan your moves, and let the music guide you to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STRATEGIZE YOUR CORE. EMBRACE THE AMBIENCE. MASTER SYMPHORIX!</h2>",
